  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - Worldwide: Renewal Procurement Assistance Program for the Government of Colombia, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Global Procurement Initiative (GPI): Procurement Assistance Program for Colombia is a national-level Program that encompasses three separate training components: 1) a virtual training series for procurement officials and other ministries of the Government of Colombia; 2) access to USTDA&apos;s Online Life-Cycle Cost Analysis (LCCA) Curriculum; and, 3) two value-based procurement Study Tours to the United States for up to 15 procurement officials from the Government of Colombia. The components would be carried out in collaboration with the Government of Colombia, the George Washington University Law School&apos;s Government Procurement Law Program, and USTDA&apos;s GPI technical specialists.</narrative>
  </description>
